omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XUxpp-zz_9UQ7kNvwF8tvjl&_nc_oc=Adoleia-PvKa-0-NWkSDezfv_6vjJnrkpbgswr99ZRadTuXUZgIVRpSxs2ZxFdEG6vw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3X7iJN3bDO9Zr-EIwgoKBbuSuJEQev7TW8IBeFD3TM8A&oe=69D78BF4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0VTIioXMvGoQ7kNvwFyONZx&_nc_oc=Adqt2zOMsXML3iRSVmtzp3iwC1L4X2mD1_bEJXRN7Bj9jRlI8oVtnAjdqgy6vGc0xhc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2XbsORdE5OYKACN8qju73k-KOr5XrvlS3Q9gmtRpuzDQ&oe=69D78D56"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qIF2WGowIroQ7kNvwGd1uv2&_nc_oc=AdpnGsfoPFQSwXB13qlFpcEwKA0zj85Pu9ddB-KIGELAaw1oOIYUkxPO-6T3Wbel8g0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0150sT2e0ZWWvMmU38bh2N92Z1dOm78GcnKe72d-S-hQ&oe=69D7A277"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://